{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10013_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b5364dfaafd5a9a906b6fcda4925ddca56fb15475c9b01cf0b5cddbfd9f6dcf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66eb65994b277b15df32a399b2cb59bae15dbfb036f19c02aabc94a2fe8d6572",
      "text": "“还要继续玩英雄游戏啊～\n真玩不腻呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f1420108a24990efd9ece27c442877a00bb088393143628b0d081d5470905e",
      "text": "“因为笃志最喜欢英雄了嘛”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d066e367dfabbbda76acc32661df60d24f02800cbc5e9917a13eb986d65c46",
      "text": "“那当然！\n等长大以后，我可是要成为英雄的！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9f001862185e91e227aa74efb7621e70ca199a494957954819442f1fdfa575",
      "text": "“你们两个也有想成为的目标吧？\n会变成什么样的大人呢，我现在就好期待啊！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89083393fe9ddec69484b3fc0b6af40e6058630e8aa41da166f9d18ddd188f18",
      "text": "“这副景象，我隐约有点印象……\n在那里的，是我们吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f4c66ea45320e0368de1a7617e793996fec71538aedf0f2f35d96ad95fe84e0",
      "text": "“恐怕是的……在我身边，直到那个年纪\n还在玩英雄游戏的也就只有笃志了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac8e299ae09dc2a089173ac602ad3e45ffc7bfab0c3dd0d2aed40a7b6cb07a5",
      "text": "“那是因为我足够喜欢啊！\n好嘞，我去确认一下。喂——！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5916d10d18932b80255793512ece12a4633b4f7e4ade96bf4e8b57bc38148b92",
      "text": "“嗯？你谁啊，大叔”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46dd52a5b1917397082d3ae1e527a3ea58f58a70d708ac765358959346bf5482",
      "text": "“才不是大叔！不对，话说你那条变身腰带\n好帅啊。那么老旧的款式，亏你能弄到啊？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cab090e91421d6b293edcaec16aa8eb43b27a641b36a43328d62465e318398",
      "text": "“哈啊？你在说什么呢。\n现在电视里正播着呢好不好。才一点都不老旧呢！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45c045cd938edcb79efc81e13d5a6fda4cd850df80dd8e2071ec739d6d170f1",
      "text": "“糟了，都这个时间了！\n想看的电视节目要开始了。快回去吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5adc520aa331db80ddae087e4616e0a33a219c7e5f3614f08c8d4a5b5c73b586",
      "text": "“是啊。你们两个，\n作业还没做完吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f48a0811f5d8eef6f65262ddfd635408a7828ae10c4d7868da557d802acd3c",
      "text": "“哇呃。圣士的说教又要开始了！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da52d056db9958cf14ed12a3020009ee785f6fff728d0e8ccb74e361077cc35e",
      "text": "“听到了吗。管那个长得很像圣士的小鬼，\n叫圣士了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10013_01:1_3_10013_01_f:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea596fb2c777f51211a923b3ee320dd0ceddf3103b316f72b4dca8b84ed673c2",
      "text": "“……那帮家伙毫无疑问，就是小时候的我们”",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
